From 5663b7782ed3d46c0646cc53593dca672b997b84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:23:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure block-file metadata and import diagnostics

Keep existing signed file numbers, CBlockFileInfo summary text and import paths
in distinct fields, and copy snapshot/checkpoint BlockHash values directly.
Preserve Info (including historical Warning wording), locks, disk layout,
imports, interruption returns and checkpoint reconsider/unpark decisions.
Expose all seven actual unsigned block-file metadata members as queryable
fields beside the byte-identical summary, including used undo-file bytes.
Two identical interruption producers use one stable event. Pruning role and
zero-padded reindex filenames remain deferred until their exact rendering has
focused support; this commit does not silently change either.

Add a real one-node DB reload plus empty-file and missing-file imports, checking
typed fields and exact readable text while height remains zero. Snapshot count
restoration, interruption and checkpoint repair branches are not newly forced.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/block-file-metadata-import.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/blockfile294-conversion.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/node/blockstorage.cpp

Source-only checkpoint pending the combined native gate. Shared eCash owner;
no consensus or block repair policy validation claim. Preserve native276 seal.
